</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T2.2.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Positive</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T2.2.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Positive/engaged/confident state.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.T2.2.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Confused</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.T2.2.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Unclear thinking or partial understanding but still trying.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Negative</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Disappointed, frustrated, helpless emotions.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
